# macOS Finder junk — never commit.
.DS_Store

# Local-only: the pending commit message Claude writes for GitHub Desktop to
# pre-fill. Never committed or pushed. (These were tracked up to build 58 by
# mistake; the old ones live in ../_archive/schedule/commit-messages/.)
.claude-commit-msg.txt
.claude-commit-msg-*.txt

# The commit summary for the build you are about to push. NOT a dotfile on purpose:
# a leading dot makes macOS Finder hide it, and gitignoring it hides it from GitHub
# Desktop too — which made it invisible in both places at once. This name is visible
# in Finder and still never committed.
COMMIT-MESSAGE.txt

# The calendar endpoint's installed packages (functions/DEPLOY.md's `npm install`). Never
# committed; package-lock.json IS committed so the deploy is reproducible.
functions/node_modules/
